  hint: Found by a stone known as the swindon stone
  characterDescription: 'Robin

    Found by a stone known as the swindon stone

    Outfit
    inspired by neolithic people

    Ramona Robin Is a very blunt, no nonsense
    bird. She knows a lot about the layout of the Avebury site, especially the popular
    tourist locations, and regularly accompanies Sydney on her nature photography
    outings. Pointing out the best places to capture photos.

